30,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are wasting money on duplicate supplies, and the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour, billed to one person.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over an hour and a half. The outside firm has a wide arrival window and requires us to tidy first.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Usage is uneven; only a few of us really use the kitchen. Also, people are frequently away for weeks at a time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"Our standards differ wildly, which explains the inconsistency. Also, the bathroom grout gets dirty again in just eleven days.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Midori,,Previous tenants warned that permanent divisions ruined their friendship. Most of our chat arguments start with reminders about undone chores.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the time is that high, maybe the cost is worth it to avoid the billing mess I'm seeing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, it's a lot of labor. But @May, if the bathroom fails that quickly, a weekly service might not even be enough.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, if the arguments are about reminders, a rigid rota might just create more opportunities for those reminders.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, that's true. If we don't agree on what ""done"" means, any system will fail.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about us fighting. If we can avoid the ""reminder"" cycle, we'll be much happier.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a way to settle the costs monthly without it falling on one person's wallet.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The time commitment is significant. If we pay, we save hours, but we still have to tidy for the cleaner.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A rota is unfair when some people are gone for a month and others do all the cooking.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,I can't stand the unpredictability. We need a professional standard or a very strict definition of clean.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Midori,,Let's avoid permanent assignments. The previous tenants' experience sounds like a nightmare for the house atmosphere.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
