55,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B, the paid service, allows for a clear monthly invoice. It solves the out-of-pocket issue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B removes the labor burden, which is substantial. I'd rather pay than spend those hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is the traditional choice, but given the usage gaps, it's logically flawed. I prefer B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,Option B ensures a professional standard. I won't have to guess if the bathroom is actually clean.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option C might lead to more reminders and rows. Option B removes the source of conflict entirely.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, do you think the cost will cause new arguments?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"As long as the billing is transparent, it's better than arguing over a mop.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the management office already has a billing system. We just need to commit to it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,I'm fully in favor of B. It's the only way to get the grout right.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, I think we can handle a bill better than we handle resentment over chores.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A professional invoice is easier to track than a tin of receipts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It's the most rational use of our time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It's the most equitable solution for those of us with different usage patterns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,Let's just do it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Midori,,I support B for the sake of our friendship.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
